3478 #edb/ref 1069 "q-90672" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543478 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543478 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $X$ is a random variable such that $X∼U[-14,-12],$ find $\\text{Var}[X].$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543478 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0fcd3eab-4854-55ff-b2c1-1082ea396d46" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543478 #edb/ref 1074 "If the random variable $X$ is distributed uniformly over the interval $[a,b],$ then \n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\frac{(b-a)^{2}}{12}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have $a=-14$ and $b=-12.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\frac{(-12-(-14))^{2}}{12}=\\frac{4}{12}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543551 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186543292 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543551 #edb/ref 1069 "q-130714" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543551 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543551 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $X$ is a random variable such that $X∼U[3,8],$ find $\\text{SD}[X].$ Round your answer to three decimal places." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543551 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b5a32830-d248-5fc8-bc7e-b05512cbde4a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543551 #edb/ref 1074 "If the random variable $X$ is distributed uniformly over the interval $[a,b],$ then \n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\frac{(b-a)^{2}}{12}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have $a=3$ and $b=8.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\frac{(8-3)^{2}}{12}=\\frac{25}{12}.\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\text{SD}[X]=\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{12}}=\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{6}≈1.443.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543557 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186543337 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543557 #edb/ref 1069 "q-130712" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543557 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543557 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $X$ is a random variable such that $X∼U[-8,1],$ find $\\text{Var}[X].$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543557 #edb/ref 1072 #uu